Meta.documentation:Data
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:An untyped value holder.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The generic data resource — wraps arbitrary payloads so they can flow between
Meta.documentation:resources that don't speak a specific type.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Blob interface — in_octetstream_default_$all parses bytes as JSON text
Meta.documentation:into the value; out_octetstream_default offers the value as JSON bytes. Used by
Meta.documentation:http:, file: and Dawn.cast when loading content.
Meta.documentation:@port in_octetstream_default_$all — bytes parsed as JSON
Meta.documentation:@port out_octetstream_default — the value as JSON bytes
Meta.documentation:@kind value
Meta.documentation:@status internal
